#
# Guide examples that need nothing but the Koinon binaries (no cluster, no database, no network).
# hack/docs-examples.sh runs every block against a build of the checkout, in CI (job `docs examples`) and locally.
# The page that shows them is in stateracloud/koinon-docs (issue 6 there); its CI compares the page with this file
# at the release it names, as for quickstart.e1. Rules of the format: hack/docs-e1.sh header.
# Add a file here per guide; a block that needs a cluster belongs to test/e2e/commands/ instead.
# e1=cli-version
koinon-api --version
# e1=cli-keys-help
koinon-api keys --help | grep export
